<title>USA: Time Warner record label cuts jobs.</title>
<headline>Time Warner record label cuts jobs.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warner Bros Records Inc, a label under the Warner Music Group of Time Warner Inc, has cut staff, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>The spokesman would not elaborate, although a source familiar with the situation said the job cuts totalled about 70.</p>
<p>The spokesman said there are about 500 or so people employed by the label after the job cuts.</p>
</text>
